@namespace AuthWithAdmin.Client.Shared
@inject AuthWithAdmin.Client.Services.AboutDialogService About

@*
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    AppFooter — the quiet, always-present way into "אודות".

    IT NO LONGER OWNS THE DIALOG. The credits now have two entry points —
    this line and the profile menu in the top nav — so the modal moved up to
    AppLayout and both entry points ask AboutDialogService to open it. One
    dialog, one piece of open-state, two triggers.

    DELIBERATELY ALMOST NOTHING. One muted line at the foot of the page. The
    credits themselves are behind the link, not in the footer, so this adds a
    single row of text to every screen and no weight to any of them. It stays
    as the discreet fallback now that the menu carries the discoverable copy.
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
*@

<footer class="app-footer">
    <span class="app-footer-line">
        @* The year is Latin digits inside an RTL line — isolated so the bidi
           algorithm cannot reorder it against the © or the wordmark. *@
        <span class="app-footer-brand">©&nbsp;<bdi>2026</bdi>&nbsp;MOTIVA</span>
        <span class="app-footer-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <span>כל הזכויות שמורות</span>
        <span class="app-footer-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <button type="button"
                class="app-footer-about"
                @onclick="@(() => About.Open())">
            אודות
        </button>
    </span>
</footer>
